  "description": "Mars Plus ST Foldable Step-Through Utility Electric Bike\n\nThe Mars Plus ST is a foldable step-through utility electric bike built for riders who need more comfort, cargo space, and everyday convenience. Designed for commuting, errands, grocery runs, short car-trip replacement, and weekend rides, it combines a low step-through frame with a folding design, fat tires, and strong motor support.\n\nWith up to 1800W peak power and 110Nm of torque, the Mars Plus ST helps you handle hills, stop-and-go traffic, heavier loads, and rougher roads with confidence. The 48V 20Ah battery supports up to 85 miles of range, giving you more freedom for daily routes, longer commutes, and weekend detours.\n\nThe extended rear rack makes it easier to carry groceries, backpacks, delivery bags, work gear, picnic supplies, and everyday cargo. Compared with a standard folding commuter ebike, the Mars Plus ST offers more utility while remaining easier to store than a full-size cargo bike.\n\nThe step-through frame makes getting on and off simple, especially for daily riders, commuters, and anyone who wants a more accessible riding experience. The 20\" x 4.0\" fat tires provide a stable, planted feel on pavement, gravel, packed dirt, grass, and uneven city roads, while the front suspension fork helps smooth out bumps along the way.\n\nWhether you are riding to work, replacing short car trips, carrying gear, or exploring local paths, the Mars Plus ST folding utility ebike is built to make everyday transportation easier, more capable, and more fun.",
